# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deployment Notes
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# For Kubernetes/OpenShift deployments:
# - Use Secrets for sensitive values (DB_PASSWORD, SECRET_KEY, etc.)
# - Use ConfigMaps for non-sensitive configuration
# - Never hardcode credentials in deployment YAML files
#
# Example Kubernetes Secret:
#   kubectl create secret generic techmart-db-secret \
#     --from-literal=database-user=myuser \
#     --from-literal=database-password=mypassword \
#     --from-literal=database-name=techmart